X1 (a) |K2|^2 = a s: True ; g(d_rho2, d_rho2) = a + b s (-> a = |K2|^2/s at the axis): True
   control: conical c = 3/2, g_xx -> 1 along the x-axis, 9/4 along the y-axis: discontinuous: True
X1 (b) kappa2 on the axis: d/dU_s = 2/a0(tau, rho1) ; du on the axis free of U_s: True -> True
   (U_s = (1/2) d_3^2 u on the axis: True )
   control: kappa1 on the axis free of U_s (stays first order): True
X1 (c) off the axis, coefficient of d_3 u in kappa2 ~ 1/(a rho2): lim rho2 * coef = 1/a0(tau, rho1) -> True
